<title>UK: CrestaCare half-year pretax profits edge up.</title>
<headline>CrestaCare half-year pretax profits edge up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		1.0		    vs 1.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.3		    vs 0.29</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.62		   vs 2.59</p>
<p> Turnover		   22.76		  vs 21.03</p>
<p>NOTE - UK healthcare services provider CrestaCare said comparative figures last year had been restated. At the half year, the group had 3,049 available beds in 50 facilities.</p>
</text>
